## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Contacts
## Author: Devin
## Version: 1.0.0
## Notes: Your friends list, your ignore list, and every whisper and party line you have received, kept. Three tabs across the top and a Slack-shaped window under them: the people or threads down the left, the one you picked on the right. Friends and Ignore are the game's own lists with more room and a notes box. Activity is the part the game never had: a thread per person who has ever whispered you, friend or stranger, and a thread per party you have been in, with what everyone said, and a box at the bottom to answer from. Under the friends, a Suggested section: the players from your realm who stood out in your battlegrounds -- top of the damage, healing or killing-blow table, or wearing a Gladiator title -- each with a sentence saying why.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Letter_15
## SavedVariables: CommanderContactsDB
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events
## OptionalDeps: Commander_Muster

